The snapshot has 48 automated includes with empty abstracts, mostly registry records and a couple of PubMed entries. The prompt lets me fetch PubMed only for empty/truncated abstracts, so I’ll do that only for PubMed records that need it; registry entries without abstracts will have to be judged from title/record text or left undecidable if the deciding quote is insufficient.
