Most automated “includes” are not pool-moving primary trials: many are secondary/subgroup analyses of already-accounted pivotal trials, observational cohorts, models, PCI/TAVR/valve/dialysis special-population trials, or registry-only rows. I’m drilling into the ambiguous mid-list records now so the verdict table is not just keyword-matched.
