Fibrillation trial. Stroke and systemic embolic event rates per 100 patient-years were 2.93 in the normal weight group
(reference group), 2.28 in the overweight group (adjusted hazard ratio [HR] 0.81, 95% CI 0.66 to 0.99, p = 0.04) and
