A clear pattern is emerging: primary RCTs that may matter are the newer frailty/dialysis/acute-stroke/special-population trials, while the pivotal-trial follow-up papers are usually secondary analyses and therefore not pool-moving as separate trials. I’m checking the remaining ambiguous records before writing the verdict JSON.
